OL,8,     FDeputies. A woman driving a car
OL,9,     Fwith no windshield blames her
OL,10,     Fex-boyfriend.
OL,11,G0100 Winter Road Rescue
OL,12,     FDocumentary series. In Glasgow
OL,13,     Fbreakdown patrolman Mark rushes to
OL,14,     Fhelp three young lads who have
OL,15,     Fcome off a dangerous slip road.
OL,16,G0200 Trucking Hell
OL,17,     FOn the busy A1, halfway between
OL,18,     FNewcastle and Durham, an
OL,19,     Farticulated lorry has fallen down
OL,20,     Fa 20-metre embankment. The Alpha
OL,21,     FRecovery crew must work out how to
OL,22,     Fretrieve the truck.
